Version 1.0.6:

* Fixed an issue pertaining to the settings of instances where when changing that instances ram it used to cause the instance to corrupt / fail to load its data.
+ Added a way so if a instance is fabric it'll auto add its api mod & long side it kilt mod and its dependencies that allows forge/neoforge mods to load in fabric. Note that some mods may not work so if they don't please go to kilts github and report that so & so mod isn't working with kilt. This feature is a WIP for the launcher, if you run into issues that isn't compatability issues with kilt feel free to report.
+ Added a new filter to fabric instances that have kilt when they go to add new mods.
+ Added the cape system to the launcher. BUT it is a WIP so please beware that it might not work correctly.
+ Added a requirement check so when you add a mod to your instance from the mod discovery it'll try to search if it has a dependency and will try to download it. Note that this is a WIP so expect those pesky bugs.
* fixed the skin system so some of its features have been re-enabled. Still a work in progress.

= Everything from 1.0.5 remains the same except the skin fetching being re-enabled.

